From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Syed AbuTalib <lowkey@google.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vorbis: Bound part_classes slice in residue decoding

`decode_classes` relies on `out.len()` (`num_parts`) to determine how
many trailing class assignments in the final classword exceed the
remaining partitions for the current channel (`parts_per_classword >
num_parts`).

In `read_residue_inner_type_0_1`, `self.part_classes` holds
`parts_to_read * residue_channels.count()` elements, and passing an
unbounded upper slice `&mut self.part_classes[part_first + i *
parts_to_read..]` caused `out.len()` for channel `i` to include all
subsequent channels' partition classes. On the final `part_first` batch
of pass 0, when `parts_to_read` was not a multiple of
`parts_per_classword`, `decode_classes` failed to skip the excess
classes and overwrote the first partition classes of channel `i + 1`,
corrupting codebook lookups and bitstream synchronization in subsequent
passes (`pass >= 1`).

Similarly, in `read_residue_inner_type_2`, `prepare_partition_classes`
only grows `self.part_classes`, so passing `&mut
self.part_classes[part_first..]` after a long block caused `out.len()`
on subsequent short blocks to include the old long-block tail.

Bound the slices to `..parts_to_read` and `..(i + 1) * parts_to_read`.

Upstream issue: https://github.com/pdeljanov/Symphonia/issues/591
Upstream PR: https://github.com/pdeljanov/Symphonia/pull/592
Chromium bug: https://issues.chromium.org/issues/574545168
---
 .../vendor/symphonia-codec-vorbis-v0_6/src/residue.rs        | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/symphonia-codec-vorbis-v0_6/src/residue.rs b/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/symphonia-codec-vorbis-v0_6/src/residue.rs
index e3bc9f3c1cd85..8168ab838ec53 100644
--- a/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/symphonia-codec-vorbis-v0_6/src/residue.rs
+++ b/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/symphonia-codec-vorbis-v0_6/src/residue.rs
@@ -274,7 +274,7 @@ impl Residue {
                         code,
                         parts_per_classword,
                         self.setup.residue_classifications as u32,
-                        &mut self.part_classes[part_first..],
+                        &mut self.part_classes[part_first..parts_to_read],
                     );
                 }
 
@@ -377,7 +377,8 @@ impl Residue {
                             code,
                             parts_per_classword,
                             self.setup.residue_classifications as u32,
-                            &mut self.part_classes[part_first + i * parts_to_read..],
+                            &mut self.part_classes
+                                [part_first + i * parts_to_read..(i + 1) * parts_to_read],
                         );
                     }
                 }
